:CMD: config node R4 interface loopback lo0 ip-address 122.1.1.4 32
:CMD: config node R4 protocol isis interface all
:CMD: config node R4 protocol isis source-packet-routing mpls
:CMD: config node R4 protocol isis source-packet-routing mpls node-sid 1004
:CMD: config node R4 protocol isis redistribute connected

:CMD: config node R5 interface loopback lo0
